'''Clown Base''' is an [[Enemy Bases|enemy base]] that appears in the [[June Bride of the Devil]] event. It was added in [[Version 12.4 Update|Version 12.4]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Clown Base
|image = E 648.png
|first appearance = [[June Bride of the Devil##02 Banquet of Terror|#02 Banquet of Terror]]
|money drop = N/A
}}

==Enemy==
It does nothing despite its special treatment as an animated base, basically acting as a regular base that can be hurt by [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.

